FILE: assets/css/messageBox.css
FEATURE: message-box-module
DATE: 2026-10-09
PRIOR STATE: as left by feature 'modal-slide-effect' (uncommitted at the time)

REASON
NEW FILE. Styles for lanes, slots and messages. Colours are custom properties on
.vmb-msg (per type and per theme). The close button rules are two classes deep, so a
page's global button:hover cannot beat them. A leaving message gets z-index 0
(staying ones 1), so it passes behind the messages above it as it rises, not over
them. The countdown bar is a CSS animation paused by .vmb-paused.

